d or invalid.\n\nIn summary, the root structural issue the validator identified is the absence of the imported profile. Without it, a large portion of the document's referential integrity cannot be checked at all. Supplying the profile (or resolving the fragment reference) is the first concrete remediation step the document author can take to allow the validator to produce definitive pass/fail results on those checks.",
