      "text": "The last-modified field in metadata must be assigned with the date and time at the moment the file is saved with the modified content. These are two mechanisms by which tools can quickly \"know\" if a file has changed since it was last encountered. This document level UUID is the only UUID in OSCAL associated with version control.\n\nWhen converting between formats, such as XML to JSON, these values should remain the same. This enables tools to know the content within the two formats is equivalent."
